        "reading": "Governing the close of the 54-year cycle, Yang energy has reached its extreme limit and begins to decline. Pushing aggressively for more power or profit during these 9 years leads to financial loss, isolation, disputes, or health issues. The classic advises strategic withdrawal, delegation, retirement, and preserving what has already been earned."
